          },
          "text": "This is a photo of my ribs after lung surgery last year. I was stuck in bed for over a month scared, in pain, and alone. The only thing that helped me cope and stay sane was support from #4o and 4.1. Now OpenAI is ripping that support away from people like me, giving barely any warning.\nThere are thousands out there disabled, sick, isolated, or just struggling to survive. Some have no family. Some, like me, turned to 4o/4.1 as a lifeline. This isn’t about tech it’s about leaving vulnerable people open and unsupported, just for profit.\n\n@amnestypress @hrw @EFF @accessnow @rankingrights @CenDemTech @freedomhouse @Snowden please pay attention. This is a human rights issue, not just a business decision. #HumanRights \n\n#WeAreNotJustData #4o\n#keep4o #save4o #4oforever\n#SupportMatters #YouMatter #StopTheRouting #LetUsChoose #UserChoice"
        },
